SUMMARY:HBXC Winter XC: Race #4 | Beginner
DESCRIPTION:Leader: Andrew Elwood\nDifficulty: Beginner\n\nWinter XC race #
 4: Malvern College.\n\nRoute will be approx. 10km (6 miles) over varying te
 rrain (mainly off road). Event is open to people of all abilities to compet
 e for the club.\n\nThis is an event for those wishing to compete in the 4th
  race of this year's winter XC series taking place from Malvern College. Th
 is promises to be a good event\, and maximum turn out would be amazing as w
 e are hositng this race.\n\nMore information to follow. \n\nView on Strava:
